      "decision": "connected_player_items loads the persistent Item for each actor inventory row, obtains its worn row, resolves that placement inside item.equipment_placements, and clones placement.protection into protected_body_parts. selected_placement_id is the same worn row's placement_id. Missing worn row or unresolved placement yields an empty protection list; the latter can still retain Some selected ID. This is not independent arbitrary authored protection data on the ordinary producer path. Existing project_definition copies each authored placement ID/protection into persistence, and init_items populates that projection from the embedded catalog.",
