      "decision": "tactical_covered_parts maps the exact seven EquipmentBodyPart variants to fixed flags. projected_armor (prior own-L2 read) generates geometry from the matching authored placement; spawn inserts its returned ArmorItem. The strategic protected set therefore agrees with local authored placement when persistence and tactical authored catalogs represent the same admitted definitions. This shared-catalog assumption is explicit; no contradictory ordinary message or cross-deployment catalog equivalence is proved by source snapshots. Local projection still admits parallel inputs rather than an owned checked relationship.",
